    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 122,
      "zh": "1-6 动作 · F 火焰 · B 垃圾焚烧 · S 宝剑 · T 变身 · 空格合拍特效",
      "en": "1-6 moves · F flame · B incineration · S sword · T transform · Space in-sync effect"
    },
    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 128,
      "zh": "欢迎来到火柴人舞台",
      "en": "Welcome to Stickman Stage"
    },
    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 129,
      "zh": "这里不是通关游戏，而是一座属于你的火柴人表演导演台。",
      "en": "This is not a level-clearing game, but a stickman performance director's booth that belongs to you."
    },
    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 131,
      "zh": "数字键 1-6 切换六种节目：迪斯科、挥舞、太空步、诡异跑、翻跟头与谢幕鞠躬",
      "en": "Number keys 1-6 switch six acts: disco, arm waves, moonwalk, weird run, flips and a closing bow"
    },
    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 132,
      "zh": "F 手部火焰可投掷火球，点燃舞台中央的垃圾桶进行垃圾焚烧发电",
      "en": "F hand flame throws fireballs to ignite the trash can at center stage for waste-to-power incineration"
    },
    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 133,
      "zh": "S 召唤发光宝剑挥出剑光，T 进入金色超级变身，特效均可叠加",
      "en": "S summons a glowing sword that slashes light; T enters the golden super transform; effects can stack"
    },
    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 134,
      "zh": "合成鼓点驱动全部动作，踩准节拍切换动作、按空格合拍可点燃观众兴奋度",
      "en": "Synthesized beats drive every move; switch moves on the beat and press Space to sync, igniting crowd hype"
    },
    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 135,
      "zh": "开启自动导演，坐看一场随机演出；还能一键截屏保存霓虹舞台",
      "en": "Turn on the auto director to sit back and watch a random show; one click also saves a neon stage screenshot"
    },
    {
